  m_text: 'This script allows for some basic effects to be applied to the ball.


    Things
    like changing gravity, applying wind or other kinds of forces. I added a few
    that I could think of at the time. If there''s something else you can think of
    let me know!


    The capsule to your right has it set to Capsule Gravity as
    a test.'
