  m_text: 'When the ball enters the collider:

    - It will be sent to the position
    of the TeleportTarget object (yellow arrow)

    - Wait for however long you
    specify

    - Be launched from that position in the direction of LaunchTowards
    (grey arrow)


    Speed can either be maintained or set to a particular value
    in the script settings'
